{"id":"tapeecho","build":2,"port":true,"name":"Tape Echo","vendor":"Nate Bloom","identifier":"com.natebloom.tapeecho","kind":"effect","type":"Delay","description":"Airwindows TapeDelay2 (Chris Johnson, MIT): a varispeed tape loop, so moving Time bends the repeats like a real machine, with a resonant filter in the loop and flutter that follows the sound. Ping-pong and saturation in the loop; past 100% feedback it runs away.","blurb":"Airwindows TapeDelay2 (Chris Johnson, MIT): a varispeed tape loop, so moving Time bends the repeats like a real machine, with a resonant filter in the loop and flutter that follows the sound. Ping-pong and saturation in the loop; past 100% feedback it runs away.","params":[{"id":"time","label":"Time","index":0,"min":40,"max":1500,"init":380,"step":1,"unit":"ms"},{"id":"feedback","label":"Feedback","index":1,"min":0,"max":115,"init":48,"step":1,"unit":"%"},{"id":"wowflutter","label":"Wow & flutter","index":2,"min":0,"max":100,"init":35,"step":1,"unit":"%"},{"id":"tone","label":"Tone","index":3,"min":500,"max":12000,"init":3200,"step":1,"scale":"log","unit":"Hz"},{"id":"saturation","label":"Saturation","index":4,"min":0,"max":100,"init":35,"step":1,"unit":"%"},{"id":"pingpong","label":"Ping-pong","index":5,"min":0,"max":100,"init":60,"step":1,"unit":"%"},{"id":"mix","label":"Mix","index":6,"min":0,"max":100,"init":30,"step":1,"unit":"%"}],"presets":[{"name":"Dub","values":{"time":420,"feedback":72,"wowflutter":30,"tone":1800,"saturation":55,"pingpong":80,"mix":35}},{"name":"Slapback","values":{"time":110,"feedback":10,"wowflutter":15,"tone":6000,"saturation":25,"pingpong":0,"mix":30}},{"name":"Space echo","values":{"time":300,"feedback":60,"wowflutter":55,"tone":2600,"saturation":45,"pingpong":50,"mix":40}},{"name":"Runaway","values":{"time":520,"feedback":108,"wowflutter":40,"tone":2200,"saturation":70,"pingpong":70,"mix":40}}]}